{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_yuki_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_yuki_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"忍者之道","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_yuki_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"98c8ae79ea98b7d6d98c301206aded67cb3ad0046a864e7dfa26c3378ae981f6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"小雪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我和彥吾說過了，接下來，我會安排你以幹員的身份進入一家叫羅德島的醫藥公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"對，你應該已經聽說過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我只聽說小姐和他們關係很深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"公主讓我去保護小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......確實也有這樣的想法，畢竟這是個由感染者建立的組織，不過我想暉潔應該能自己處理好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者......公主覺得可靠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，放心，我見過他們的領袖，是個很不錯的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我稍微觀察了一下，感覺這是家不錯的公司，所以覺得這是個好機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"機會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"對，你從小跟隨我，來到龍門後也沒有離開過我的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"但你也該去看看外面的風景了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我只需要瞭解公主看到的風景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"這是命令，小雪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"白雪，依照文月公主的囑託，協助陳小姐行動，並聽從你的差遣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你好。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......"}]},{"label":"歡迎你！","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"4","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"5","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"觀察了數天，博士，怪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"用水壺直接在嘴裡加熱速食食品，天才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"不過此人確實在指揮用人和處理各類事務上有相當的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，羅德島，不可貌相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"表面上是醫藥公司，實際上卻近似軍事組織，頗有實力，難怪魏公會和這家公司合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"公主雖然沒有明說，但既然陳小姐在這裡，想必是要我調查這個組織，以護小姐周全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"除了博士，這裡還有兩個領導者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭我已見過，如公主所說，是個很親切的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"但既然她能成為領導者，必有過人之處，不可掉以輕心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"另一個叫凱爾希的人尚未見過，從他人談話來看，此人才是這家公司的核心人物，需要對其有所瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"艦內可通行區域的大致構造已記在腦內，時間，凌晨一點，該行動了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"進來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的管道設計，不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"條理有序，四通八達......還有相應的監控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這種程度，小意思。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"大部分通道與宿舍連接的介面都是廁所，只有部分窗口因為設計原因能看到宿舍內部的情況嗎......合理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊......古米，我要吃肉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"刻俄柏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"睡相很差。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......很好，今天的訓練量也達標了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"時間也不早了，雖然明天沒有任務，該做一下皮膚護理然後睡覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，自從成為幹員後，外表的打理真是疏忽了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"不過也沒辦法，這也算是必要的犧牲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月見夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，即使我不打理，也已經足夠帥了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"（惡寒）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員代號，月見夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"自戀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，肌肉線條不錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？時間已經這麼晚了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，再堅持一下吧，克洛絲她們的訓練方案快要設計好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕人的成長速度確實驚人，現在的她們已經和剛來到羅德島時完全不一樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，雖然距離我對她們的要求還差得遠就是了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"教官杜賓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"面冷心善。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"大部分人已經入睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅德島的人，看起來多少都頗為適應在此處生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"確實如公主所說，是個好地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......前面就不是宿舍區了，小心行事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭......哦，現在應該叫你早露了，你該休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......你先去睡吧，我一個人再訓練一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，再陪你一會兒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我讓你活了下來，你要是隨便死在戰場上，那我也太丟臉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，那就麻煩你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"兩個來自烏薩斯的學生，似乎是之前接收的難民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"切爾諾伯格，慘劇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"祝你們好運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，今天的工作就先告一段落吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，凱爾希醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這個時間博士不知道睡了沒有，我去看一眼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}有自己的分寸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然是這麼說，但是博士的身體健康也是很重要的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我看完博士就去睡覺，好不好，凱爾希醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......隨你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"這應當就是凱爾希醫生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"她似乎往這邊看了一眼，被發現了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"（她似乎沒有發現我。但是剛才的感覺究竟是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"罷了，既然沒有被發現，繼續前進吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？前面似乎有很強的噪音......方位上來推測，似乎是工程部。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_motorroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂喂，不是吧，這裡難道不應該直接親上去嗎！女主你在猶豫什麼啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，不是吧，這種橋段來一次就夠了，別每次都這樣啊，編劇你行不行啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，是我最討厭的發展方向......難怪這部劇能出到第七季而且評價越來越爛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"這根本就是在拖時間好不好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"......可惡，但是男主真的很帥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，再忍忍，說不定後面好看呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"總工程師可露希爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"據說羅德島的艦體就是她一手設計的，厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這部劇，真正的爛點還不在這裡，第四季男配的突然登場才是噩夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？不是吧？！我還以為這夠爛了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......你聽得到我說話？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，糟了，不小心接話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了，你下來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_motorroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"一開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不要誤會，你的忍者技巧確實還挺厲害的，只不過我一開始就知道你要做這件事啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是我個人的行動，與任何人無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，別緊張，你看我像是把你當成間諜的樣子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"是文月公主在把你送過來的時候特地和阿米婭通了一次電話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"她當時就告訴阿米婭，說她雖然派你來確實沒有額外的意圖，但她害怕你會做多餘的事，所以特地主動提醒我們稍微注意你一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"還給阿米婭講了一下你的一些行動模式，所以我就姑且對你多留意一下啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......這件事與公主無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，你這人好難搞哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我也覺得我的話沒什麼說服力啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你要是真的被認為是間諜的話，剛才在路上應該直接就被凱爾希幹掉了哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，念在你是初犯，你可以不用擔心你會因為這件事受到懲罰或者牽連到你家公主什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我也確實不推薦你再用剛才那種方式在羅德島上走來走去就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"一方面，核心區域你是絕對，絕——對進不去的，至少靠管道肯定不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"另一方面，窺探別人隱私也不是什麼好事啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你這樣不累嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"不累。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有下次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"然後去尋找別的方法是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，好想把你丟給凱爾希，忠誠的人真是難搞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，反正凱爾希有一句話讓我轉告你，“你可以用你的方式觀察羅德島，但羅德島也在觀察你”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，其實你要是真的覺得晚上無聊想跑來跑去，可以來陪我一起看劇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"看你剛才好像也對這方面有些研究的樣子，羅德島上大部分都是戶外派，我都找不到幾個同好，都要憋死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你在看的這部，確實沒有再看下去的價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以推薦一些，不知道你有沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"char_007_closre","isRemote":false,"text":"你說說看，要是沒有的話，我去找來我們一起看就是了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白雪","speakerId":"char_118_yuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_007_closre","aliases":["可露希爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_115_headbr","aliases":["凜冬"]},{"speakerId":"char_118_yuki","aliases":["白雪"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜賓"]},{"speakerId":"char_197_poca","aliases":["早露"]},{"speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","aliases":["文月"]},{"speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","aliases":["？？？"]},{"speakerId":"char_283_midn","aliases":["月見夜"]}]}
